msgid "Quebec SBD Remunerated Hours"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_payroll
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_ca_corporate_tax_payroll.model_hr_employee
msgid "Employee"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_payroll
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ca_corporate_tax_payroll.field_hr_employee__l10n_ca_qc_sbd_majority_shareholder
msgid "Majority Voting Shareholder"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_payroll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ca_corporate_tax_payroll.field_hr_employee__l10n_ca_qc_sbd_majority_shareholder
msgid ""
"The employee holds, directly or indirectly, the majority of the voting "
"shares of the company. The hours of the done payslips count in the Quebec "
"small business deduction remunerated hours multiplied by the shareholder "
"hours factor."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_corporate_tax_payroll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ca_corporate_tax_payroll.field_l10n_ca_paid_hours_line__source
msgid ""
"A person holding, directly or indirectly, the majority of the voting shares "
"counts all the hours worked to take an active part in the business, paid or "
"not, multiplied by the shareholder hours factor. The hours paid through "
"payroll already count with that factor when the employee is flagged as "
"majority voting shareholder: a manual line holds only the hours worked "
"without pay. Other people count only paid hours."
msgstr ""

